{"ID":"20230927095417-gt34bep","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230927095417-gt34bep","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927095417-gt34bep\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927095423-oftlf0m\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927095423-8dvo3vm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927095423-8dvo3vm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:34,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:34\u0026#125;","title":"【小柴胡加茯苓白术汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20230927095423"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230927095423-oftlf0m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927095423-oftlf0m","updated":"20230927095423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组成：柴胡半斤、黄芩三两、人参三两、半夏半升(洗)、甘草三两(炙)、生姜三两(切)、大枣十二枚(劈）、茯苓三两、白术三两"}]},{"ID":"20230927095423-tsr9d75","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927095423-tsr9d75","updated":"20230927095423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右九味，以水一斗二升，煮取六升，去滓，再煎取三升，温服一升，日三服。"}]},{"ID":"20230927095423-8dvo3vm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927095423-8dvo3vm","updated":"20230927095423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"太阴病，吐逆，腹中冷痛，雷鸣下利，脉沉紧者，小柴胡加茯苓白术汤主之。"}]}]}